","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghui-yue-jun-ke:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghui-yue-jun-ke"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete-2-9","title":"郡吏","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"50g_lnx_uee","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete-2-9:a","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete:p002","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"郡吏","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete:p002:m0011","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete-ws2261984","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete:p002","quote":"出補義興太守。輙錄郡吏陳伯喜付陽羨獄，欲殺之，縣令孔逭不知何罪，不受繢教，爲有司所奏，繢坐白衣領職。遷太子中庶子，領驍騎，轉長兼侍中。世祖出射雉，繢信佛法，稱疾不從駕。轉左民尚書，以母老乞解職，改授寧朔將軍、大司馬長史、淮陵太守。出爲宣城太守，秩中二千石。隆昌元年，遷輔國將軍、太傅長史，不拜。仍爲冠軍將軍、豫章內史。進號征虜。又坐事免官。除冠軍將軍，司徒左長史，散騎常侍，隨王師。除征虜將軍，驃騎長史，遷散騎常侍，太常。永元元年，卒。年五十三。諡靖子。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-complete:p002:m0011"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-nan023-wanghui_sons-m2-45","person_id":"50g_lnx_uee","title":"郡吏","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nan023-wanghui_sons-m2-45:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghui-yue-jun-ke:p002:m0047","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghui-yue-jun-ke:p002","surface":"郡吏","start":45,"end":47}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanghui-yue-jun-ke-ws2478204","chapter_id